# Files not uploaded to Cloud Build.
#
# Without this file, `gcloud builds submit` falls back to `.gitignore` to
# decide what to send. That file excludes `data/`, which the image needs, so
# the build fails at `COPY data ./data`. Keep the two in sync by hand: the
# rules here are deliberately different.

.gcloudignore
.git
.gitignore

# Secrets. The PIN reaches the container through Cloud Run, never the image.

.Renviron
.secrets

# Development leftovers.

.quarto
.Rproj.user
.temp
.vscode
_freeze
docs
**/*.Rproj
**/.DS_Store
**/.Rhistory
**/.RData

# renv activates a project library that does not exist in the image.

.Rprofile
renv/
